+# Reservation checkout expiration in Slack
+
+In `/reserve`, required checkouts must cover the entire reservation, through
+the displayed calculated end. Changing Date, Start time, or Duration refreshes
+the available choices and warning.
+
+Duration choices stop when a required checkout expires. A checkout remains valid
+through its displayed Eastern calendar date, so a reservation may end at midnight
+at the start of the next day. Whole-day bookings follow local calendar days.
+
+If a selected duration is too long, it is reduced to the greatest valid choice.
+If no duration works, the form shows **Review selection** and names the required
+checkout. Choose an earlier date or start time, change the resources, or request
+checkout renewal in the Member Portal. Review the calculated end before submitting.
+
+Tools and groups you cannot reserve through the selected end are hidden unless
+already selected. A selected resource marked **(checkout required)** remains
+visible so you can correct it. Shop and group prerequisites also apply.
